# LF everywhere: the scan, the Makefile, the C build and the setup script all
# assume it, and the repository is worked on from Windows, WSL and Linux.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.uf2 binary
*.png binary
*.pdf binary
# Vendored third party sources are kept byte for byte as upstream ships them
# (CRLF included) so the digests in lib/waveshare/PROVENANCE.md stay true.
lib/waveshare/EPD_* -text
